        {
          "id": "the_temperature_stage_is_absent_and_the_air_conditioning_arm_is_dead",
          "description": "S15's temperature arm, adjust.rs:87-142. Pollutant 1 is not 118 or 112 (the PM arm), not the fuel-9 energy pollutant 91 (the EV arm) and not 3 (the NOx arm), so every rate row here takes the FALL-THROUGH quadratic; `noxhumidityadjust` is populated in this snapshot and is read by nothing, which is why this fixture has no humidity variables at all. `temperatureadjustment` has ZERO rows, so both arms of `exact_else_wildcard` miss and A and B are the additive identity: the factor is exactly 1 everywhere. That is ABSENT and not merely inert, and the difference is visible here -- `process-crankcase-running` and `process-nox-speciation` each had four unreachable rows and this snapshot has none. The A/C arm is live in its table and dead in its result: `fullacadjustment` carries 23 real polProcessID 101 rows and `rtDay_meanBaseRateACAdj` is a real number, but the activity quadratic clamps to 0 at this heat index so none of it reaches an emitted cell (docs/process-airtoxics.md 7.2.7).",
